{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"right... I figured it would be more involved and interesting... possibly sleight of hand to switch clips without losing a beat, or some sort of check to skip damage tiers faster.... especially important as most combats dont go a ton of rounds (maybe even skip the spin up round)... it would need a lot of tweaking to make it feel good, but might be a starting place","created_at":"2020-08-25T21:01:52.972000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747923729954111552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
