{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"I'm thinking it'll be s 2 person siege weapon. 1 person cranks and the other aims/reloads","created_at":"2020-08-26T03:13:27.335000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748017239290150943","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"I'm thinking of ammo for some of these weapons like the Tesla coil. Maybe it consumes a lightning elemental, to give it a cost and make it feel special when it's used.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:18:58.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748441414731300884","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"Maybe it summons one with a chance to overload and break the weapon permanently.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:19:41.836000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-27T07:19:47.499000Z","id":"748441595904262175","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"In the airship section, I was imagining that people would choose a profession, like gunner, engineer, or something like that. Maybe the big weapons will take two gunners or one gunner and one engineer to even work.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:20:20.529000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748441758194729072","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"They would each have to spend their actions operating the huge weapon.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:21:05.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748441946908917820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"Also, maybe the crewed ship would share an initiative, and the captain decides crew order internally. That would cut down on initiative tracking for these battles, let the crew discuss/metagame in their own little ship chat, and then act as a team.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:23:33.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748442566684573757","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"innnteressssting","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:23:55.526000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748442659957506118","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"Also, the large weapons would take two or more stations on a ship.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:24:23.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748442778224033794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"For example, say a Tesla coil takes three stations. A light class ship would have 6 slots total (1d6 hit die). The 3 basic slots would be filled already, rudder (1), engine (2), envelope (3), and the other three would be taken up by the weapon (4,5,6)","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:26:21.842000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748443273651290172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"When the ship takes damage over a threshold, (say 10 damage) roll a d6 and disable one station. If it was a 4,5, or 6, the weapon is disabled, and the crew will have to figure out how to best use their actions to get it fixed, and back into the fight by the next turn, all while maneuvering into position for a good strike.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:28:18.005000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748443760874094592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"747056520528658472","content":"Furthermore, as small ship like this with that huge weapon is a glass cannon, just waiting to get shot out of the sky. Maybe better to buy a larger ship with 8, 10, or 12 stations so you can also add armor, or more maneuverability.","created_at":"2020-08-27T07:30:12.533000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"748444241239212073","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
